                                "sense_id": "844ed6ab-d77e-3fea-aaab-252480f66ccf",
                                "text": "Les livres, les poèmes sanscrits."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac0dcfb7-1802-4c97-a2c3-9b145171a9bf",
